:name: NUCLEO-F446RE sensor node
:description: Runs build/firmware.elf on an emulated NUCLEO-F446RE with a BME280 on I2C1.

using sysbus
$name?="nucleo-f446re"
$elf?=@build/firmware.elf

mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/stm32f446_nucleo.repl

// USART2 is the ST-LINK virtual COM port on the real board (PA2/PA3).
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

// Initial sensor values; change them from the monitor, e.g. `i2c1.bme280 Temperature 30`.
i2c1.bme280 Temperature 25.0
i2c1.bme280 Humidity 50.0
i2c1.bme280 Pressure 1013.25

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset

// Uncomment to debug with arm-none-eabi-gdb (target remote :3333):
// machine StartGdbServer 3333
